### Unlike Post
# Same toggle endpoint as likePost.http. There is no DELETE variant:
# calling it while the post is liked removes the like and returns data=false.
POST http://localhost:8080/1/likes/toggle
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE

###

### List My Likes
# The {postId} segment is inherited from the class-level mapping and ignored here
GET http://localhost:8080/1/likes/my-likes
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_HERE
